  // wave sits still for as long as the flow holds it — the reference photograph's caps
  // are pinned to the break and it is the foam they shed that runs downstream. So the
  // cell field is anchored to world position exactly like the standing-wave field this
  // module already declares stationary, and each cell instead breathes on its own
